## Memory Bank Protocol – mersch75test.github.io (mersch75.lu)

You must manage project knowledge through the `memory-bank/` directory.

1. At the beginning of every task, read all files in `memory-bank/`.
2. `memory-bank/integrationContext.md` contains all dependencies related to `Vereins-OS`, hosting parameters for Hetzner and GitHub Pages, and `M75-VideoStudio`.
3. When changing frontend components that consume data from `Vereins-OS`, verify the endpoints in the `Vereins-OS/` directory.
4. After completing a work step, update `memory-bank/progress.md`.
5. Do not load video or large image files from `M75-VideoStudio` into context, to stay within the 200k-token limit.
